# Development-only direct Orchestrator requests. Production clients use Gateway authentication.
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8083
@companyId = 11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111
@accountId = 22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222
@userId = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333

### All days, planned obligations, confirmed schedules and earlier overdue plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orchestrator/companies/{{companyId}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/payment-calendar?fromDate=2026-11-01&toDate=2026-11-30
X-User-Id: {{userId}}

### Invalid reversed range: 422 INVALID_RANGE for an authorized member
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orchestrator/companies/{{companyId}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/payment-calendar?fromDate=2026-11-30&toDate=2026-11-01
X-User-Id: {{userId}}
